<title>SWEDEN: Average yield 7.12 pct in Sweden 9-yr bond auction.</title>
<headline>Average yield 7.12 pct in Sweden 9-yr bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of nine year bonds was 7.12 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p> Volume issued (billions)		2.00</p>
<p> Total bids    (billions)		4.86</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		    1</p>
<p> Number of bids				44</p>
<p> Lowest yields (pct)		     7.12</p>
<p> Highest yields			    7.12</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		  7.12</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
